<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>For Someone Special ❤️</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(to right, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
            color: #333;
            padding: 50px;
        }
        img {
            width: 200px;
            height: 200px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 4px solid white;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
        }
        .poetry {
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 20px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>For [Esha] ❤️</h1>

    <img src="https://postimg.cc/DSGj4z92" alt="Her Picture">

    <div class="poetry">
        <p>You're not just a person,<br>
        you're my favorite feeling. 💫</p>

        <p>Even in a crowded world,<br>
        my eyes always search for you. 🌙</p>

        <p>I don’t know about forever,<br>
        but I know I choose you today. ❤️</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
